1. Find Pivot Index:

Code:
class Solution {
    public int pivotIndex(int[] nums) {
        
        int totalSum = 0;

        for (int num : nums) {
            totalSum += num;
        }

        int leftSum = 0;

        for (int i = 0; i < nums.length; i++) {

            int rightSum = totalSum - leftSum - nums[i];

            if (leftSum == rightSum) {
                return i;
            }

            leftSum += nums[i];
        }

        return -1;
    }
}

Approach:
Calculate the total sum of the array first. Then traverse the array while maintaining the leftSum. For each index,
calculate rightSum = totalSum - leftSum - nums[i] and check whether leftSum == rightSum.

Complexity
Time Complexity: O(n)
Space Complexity: O(1)

